{"id":"oni","lemma":"они","pos":"pron","rank":26,"glosses":["they"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/4/46/Ru-%D0%BE%D0%BD%D0%B8.ogg/Ru-%D0%BE%D0%BD%D0%B8.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Они тихо говорили.","en":"They talked quietly.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/926853","words":[null,{"g":"quietly"},{"g":"to speak, to talk","l":"говорить"}]},{"text":"Они наши друзья.","en":"They're our friends.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/931341","words":[null,{"g":"our, ours","l":"наш"},{"g":"close friend","l":"друг"}]},{"text":"Они о тебе говорят.","en":"They're talking about you.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/1283339","words":[null,{"g":"about"},{"g":"(to) you","l":"ты"},{"g":"to speak, to talk","l":"говорить"}]},{"text":"Они знают?","en":"Do they know?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/152574","words":[null,{"g":"to know: to be familiar…","l":"знать"}]},{"text":"Кто они такие?","en":"Who are they?","words":[{"g":"who"},null,null]}]}